        "subject": "LU-19683 tests: skip sanity-quota 1h and 1l on old servers",
        "message": "LU-19683 tests: skip sanity-quota 1h and 1l on old servers\n\nThe tail of sanity-quota 1h (fallocate quota enforcement for\nuser, group and project) needs the server side fix from\nLU-19018, and 1l needs the one from LU-19791. Interop runs\nwith 2.15 and 2.16 servers do not have them and fail with\n\"Write success, expect EDQUOT\" in 1h and \"old and new files\ndiffer\" in 1l (or on 2.15, no root_prj_enable parameter).\n\nReturn from 1h before the fallocate checks, and skip 1l,\nwhen the servers are too old.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: If790ed9f1efbb0748a06d4d0adbaebcfc67fb444\n"
      },
